PART 1 -- g_00 SECTOR: exact lapse law, beta_PPN, the Phi_1 coefficient, kernel corrections
======================================================================================================
  [ok] 1.1 N = e^{Psi/c^2}: C_M == D.[mu(|DPsi|/a0) DPsi] - 4 pi G rho EXACTLY (all orders in 1/c^2)
         so g_00 = -e^{2Psi/c^2} exactly, with Psi solving the mu-Poisson equation -- no PN nonlinearities enter the lapse sector at any order
  [ok] 1.2 rho_m = rho* (1 + v^2/2c^2) + O(c^-4) for dust  (rho* = conserved rest-mass density)
         rho_m/rho* = v2/2 + 1
  [ok] 1.3 -g_00 = 1 - 2U + 2U^2 + O(U^3)  =>  coefficient 2 beta U^2 gives beta_PPN = 1 EXACTLY
         -g_00 series = -4*U**3/3 + 2*U**2 - 2*U + 1
  [ok] 1.4 coefficient of Phi_1 in g_00 = 1  (GR: 4).  With gamma from Part 2 this forces alpha_3 != 0
         g_00 = -2*Phi1*Uf**2 + 2*Phi1*Uf - Phi1 + 2*Uf**2 - 2*Uf + 1  (cross terms U*Phi1 are O(c^-6))

